{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01807",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.51,
      "end_seconds": 4.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Erm, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.23,
      "end_seconds": 8.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.28,
      "end_seconds": 17.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "Hmm, mainly I've been putting on weight over the years. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.24,
      "end_seconds": 21.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.2,
      "end_seconds": 28.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.4,
      "end_seconds": 31.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "So, when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.79,
      "end_seconds": 64.08,
      "duration_seconds": 31.29,
      "text": "It's been going on for one week. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. Yeah, um, as for getting out of breath, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. I mean, and I've been snoring as well, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.87,
      "end_seconds": 66.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any palpitations or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.87,
      "end_seconds": 73.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "I haven't had palpitations or low mood, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.38,
      "end_seconds": 79.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain or high thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.41,
      "end_seconds": 85.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.07,
      "end_seconds": 87.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.15,
      "end_seconds": 90.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.63,
      "end_seconds": 96.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.59,
      "end_seconds": 100.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.66,
      "end_seconds": 113.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.19,
      "end_seconds": 122.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Right, no, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.04,
      "end_seconds": 126.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.27,
      "end_seconds": 149.14,
      "duration_seconds": 21.87,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.36,
      "end_seconds": 159.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.32,
      "end_seconds": 163.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.74,
      "end_seconds": 179.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.05,
      "end_seconds": 188.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.34,
      "end_seconds": 220.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "Okay: weight 55 kilos, pulse 79, height 152 centimetres. And temperature is 36.9 degrees, BMI works out to 23.8, blood pressure 152 over 92, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.56,
      "end_seconds": 223.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.88,
      "end_seconds": 229.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.55,
      "end_seconds": 232.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.89,
      "end_seconds": 249.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Your weight and waist measurement are both above the healthy range."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.21,
      "end_seconds": 254.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.21,
      "end_seconds": 284.01,
      "duration_seconds": 20.8,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, I think we're dealing with obesity with weight-related symptoms at this stage. Another possibility is an underactive thyroid. Let's get a cholesterol test, for obesity. Aim for a loss of half a kilo a week with smaller portions and a daily thirty-minute walk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.22,
      "end_seconds": 304.48,
      "duration_seconds": 20.26,
      "text": "Right, right. I think the weight management service should see you too. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. See me again in three months. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.53,
      "end_seconds": 310.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.12,
      "end_seconds": 313.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}